ac89c514dd6242f580d2e0d065abec17","event_uuid":"01b0c23d-57e6-43f1-9825-ab7543b62dad","position":{"commit_sha":"c0168ab831794ec8600b63455aefdc4d6ccbe786","position":"1788907530345207768-01b0c23d-57e6-43f1-9825-ab7543b62dad"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGNNmnI/WYNJAOKH9yvo0l+tMYJR2tK2UV4H8ReXBQU5 rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com rotated-20260907"},{"content_hash":"f8203d07e4cb0c282a01bc48aae33a6a0dbc6002b822f1e5395a923fa01a8295","event_uuid":"ffed2045-ff18-4a08-8953-98eea1e371b1","position":{"commit_sha":"c7f5baf8ad846d37fb0a4da16aef67ddaa242ec7","position":"1788909103508691001-ffed2045-ff18-4a08-8953-98eea1e371b1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"f1f43be7fa6fb68b4f2c3e446b52b78acc6d9dc0d8bd8a5cfcce9fee23c95d78","event_uuid":"efb1b452-7e41-44dd-894c-dd1372b1f343","position":{"commit_sha":"23c9c1e6ae03da04c42589e7cdf6a8ce19fdcdaa","position":"1788909127555313001-efb1b452-7e41-44dd-894c-dd1372b1f343"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"RCA: the deferred R-4 findings are still live on current main. Bedrock-configured repos are still invisible to `_live_criteria_eval_available`; empty `--changed-since \"\"` is not treated as a null/no-baseline ref; and `_run_selected_criteria_live` swallows per-criterion LLMError without returning success/failure counts, so `--require-live` can exit 0 after zero successful live evaluations. Proceeding with a narrow CLI/test fix.","timestamp":1788902165331350001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review remediation: narrowed the Bedrock availability contract to provider identity only. The implementation will not claim to prove AWS credential usability from env/config; instead it will treat a Bedrock-configured model as worth attempting live eval, and the required zero-success non-zero exit under `--require-live` is the guard that turns an uncredentialed Bedrock configuration red rather than green-skipped.","timestamp":1788902871235313001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Plan-review remediation: the empty --changed-since case also needs a dispatch fix, not only `_is_null_ref`; the dispatcher must use `args.changed_since is not None` so a present-but-empty flag reaches `_criteria_eval_changed_since`, where `_is_null_ref` can return the clean no-baseline no-op.","timestamp":1788903629667207001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Review follow-up before submit: updated docs/exit-codes.md for the new criteria eval exit-1/empty-ref semantics and added coverage that `criteria eval T8 --changed-since \"\"` remains a mutual-exclusion error because the flag is present.","timestamp":1788909127555313001}],"created_at":1788530503599155001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"1024f362-d491-4741-9705-ab503b9c9109","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"5169-ab69-9c23-4f8b"},{"link_uuid":"01b0c23d-57e6-43f1-9825-ab7543b62dad","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"a3f5-79b1-e0f1-478b"}],"description":"## Context\n\nDeferred non-blocking advisories from the change-triggered criterion-eval work (ticket 5169,\nepic R-4 `spin-cub-usher` / 65dd-e93b-666a-4caa). Each was dispositioned defer-followup: all\nare non-blocking, LLM-Review+1 was granted, the `eval-changed-rubrics` job is\ncontinue-on-error, and CI itself uses ANTHROPIC/OPENAI credentials so the gating is correct\nfor CI today. They matter for portability (non-CI / Bedrock-only environments) and test\ncoverage, so they are collected here rather than dropped.\n\n## Scope\n\n`src/rebar/_cli/_llm_eval_commands.py` (the live criteria-eval availability check and the\nchange-triggered run loop) and its unit tests.\n\n## Deferred items to disposition\n\n- [ ] `_live_criteria_eval_available` gates on ANTHROPIC/OPENAI env only; a Bedrock repo\n      model with Bedrock creds is seen as \"no live\", so a Bedrock-only environment silently\n      skips the live half.\n- [ ] Fail-open: when live is available but every criterion raises LLMError, the run returns\n      None and the caller exits 0 unconditionally, even under `--require-live`.\n- [ ] Empty `--changed-since ''` is not treated as a null ref; it falls through to the\n      missing-criterion error (exit 2) instead of a clean no-op.\n- [ ] The per-criterion LLMError recovery path in the live-run loop has no test.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Each item above is either fixed (with a covering test where it is a correctness or\n      coverage gap) or explicitly accepted with a one-line reason recorded on this ticket.\n      In particular, decide whether `--require-live` must fail non-zero when live was\n      available but produced no successful evaluation.\n\n## Budget\n\nTo be estimated when claimed.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nCurrent `rebar criteria eval --changed-since` fixed several R-4 review findings, but the deferred follow-ups are still real on current main. `_live_criteria_eval_available` only treats Anthropic/OpenAI API-key env vars as live, so a Bedrock-configured repo with AWS ambient credentials is reported as no-live. `_run_selected_criteria_live` catches every per-criterion `LLMError` and returns no success/failure summary, so `_criteria_eval_changed_since` exits 0 whenever live was considered available, even if every selected criterion failed under `--require-live`. `_is_null_ref` recognizes all-zero SHAs but not an explicitly empty `--changed-since ''`, so that input reaches the missing-criterion/error path instead of the same clean first-push/no-baseline no-op. The per-criterion `LLMError` branch is also behaviorally unpinned.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Add unit tests for the remaining live changed-criteria edge cases: Bedrock provider-identity availability (not credential usability), `--require-live` failing non-zero when all selected live criteria raise `LLMError`, empty `--changed-since ''` returning the null-ref no-op, and mixed live runs continuing after one criterion-level `LLMError` while reporting that failure.\n- Update `_live_criteria_eval_available` to recognize Bedrock by provider identity only: when the agents runtime is installed and `LLMConfig.from_env()` plus `resolve_model`/`infer_provider` resolves the configured model provider to `bedrock`. This does not cheaply prove AWS credential usability; a Bedrock-configured but uncredentialed environment is intentionally allowed to attempt live execution, and the new `--require-live` zero-success failure is the safety net that makes that misconfiguration red instead of a silent green skip.\n- Have the live selected-criteria loop return a success count so `--require-live` can fail when live execution was attempted but produced zero successful evaluations.\n- Distinguish a present `--changed-since` flag from an absent one by checking `args.changed_since is not None` in the dispatcher and mutual-exclusion guard, then treat the present-but-empty value as a null/no-baseline ref in `_is_null_ref`.\n\n## Testing\n\n- RED: run the new targeted tests first and confirm they fail on current main.\n- GREEN: run `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_changed_criteria.py -q`.\n- Run `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint` and `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make typecheck`.\n- Before push, run `env -u GIT_CONFIG_COUNT -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0 -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_1 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_1 -u GIT_CONFIG_KEY_2 -u GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_2 PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make verify`.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/_llm_eval_commands.py","reason":"Fix live changed-criteria availability, null-ref, and require-live failure disposition."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_changed_criteria.py","reason":"Add regression coverage for the deferred changed-criteria follow-up items."},{"path":"docs/exit-codes.md","reason":"Document the new criteria eval exit semantics for empty changed-since and require-live zero-success failures."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","a3f5-79b1-e0f1-478b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"de566dba-ffe9-4780-a793-c25c2b8e884c","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"87a9-043b-9028-449e","ticket_type":"task","title":"Follow-up: live criteria-eval availability gating and fail-open under --require-live (R-4)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["db4fbf42-7e68-4fa0-ab0e-d8a1e6fd839c","2cb9287e-64ea-47d6-acac-471a87133360","64cccbb3-1f18-4cf1-a3d1-197ca6c7cd5c","9cc6a0df-db82-4f0e-95e7-784d937cdf4d","3fce7c8e-f0f0-4651-95a5-485b28e7a0e8","9104f056-faed-4408-ac86-11c954939717","5154a387-5dea-48c4-b3b2-7dfbdae75623","da86dd37-3a17-4b5a-a494-a8e76a07a1c8","de566dba-ffe9-4780-a793-c25c2b8e884c","5b00a41d-15a2-45e1-a524-67739f389ea4","01b0c23d-57e6-43f1-9825-ab7543b62dad","ffed2045-ff18-4a08-8953-98eea1e371b1","efb1b452-7e41-44dd-894c-dd1372b1f343"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788912489232716001,"uuid":"9c51a481-9416-4c2b-b53e-a87ea017664b"}